{"id":"653268","name":"凉拌佛手瓜","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/653268/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"佛手瓜","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所需食材。","img":"images/653268/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"佛手瓜去皮洗净擦丝。","img":"images/653268/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"佛手瓜放入热水中煮熟。","img":"images/653268/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮熟的佛手瓜丝用冷水多冲洗几遍后沥干水分。","img":"images/653268/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"佛手瓜丝放入碗中加入一勺生抽。","img":"images/653268/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入一勺蚝油。","img":"images/653268/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入两勺米醋。","img":"images/653268/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入一勺白砂糖。","img":"images/653268/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入一勺盐。","img":"images/653268/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入一勺鸡精。","img":"images/653268/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"喜欢吃辣的可以加点辣椒碎搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/653268/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"佛手瓜很容易熟，煮的时候要快一点，煮久了影响口感和营养。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}